<Layout title="Candidate Forum" description="Bloomington DSA is hosting a “Candidate Forum” for upcoming elections in Monroe County, the Statehouse, and Congress! Join the forum, meet the candidates, and make sure our representative truly represent us." headline="presents...">

<section>
<h1><span class="serif bigheader">Candidate<br> <span class="stroke">Forum!</span></span></h1>
<p>Our 2026 Candidate Forum is finished! 2 nights; 10 candidates; 4 upcoming local, state, and federal elections.</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>Watch Night 1: Monroe County</h2>

